WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,140 --> 00:00:05,140
I know one, he lives in Wudong 1704, his name is Li Xiaoyan

2
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:11,860
Is there a goddess in this building? I never noticed it

3
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:15,260
Aren't you talking about yourself?

4
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:20,220
That's right, I'm talking about me

5
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:21,220
You are playing tricks on me

6
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:26,370
Don't look at me like this, it's because I haven't showered or put on makeup

7
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:30,370
As long as you let me take a shower and put on makeup, I will never be worse than the one next to you

8
00:00:30,370 --> 00:00:31,370
What did you do before?

9
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:34,370
I am the HR director of a company

10
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:40,610
No wonder, when I listen to you talk, I feel like you are not caring about others.

11
00:00:40,610 --> 00:00:46,240
Okay, I'll give you a chance to be my practical female subordinate first.

12
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:49,240
If you perform well first, you will have a chance to be promoted to politics

13
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:57,020
It's just applicable. Just agree first. There will be plenty of opportunities in the future.

14
00:00:57,020 --> 00:01:00,230
I can cook

15
00:01:00,230 --> 00:01:06,300
No, aunt, you can be my mother at your age

16
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:09,460
Just don't make trouble

17
00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:12,460
I know one, Xia Qingyou, he is a native of Jiangcheng
